# 🧭 Daily Priorities

A standing reference for steering your day. Scan this each morning and whenever you feel unfocused.

---

## 1. 👶 Cyrus
His immediate needs come first — feeding, sleep, comfort, presence.

## 2. 🤝 Camille & Relationship / Partnership
Show up for Camille as a partner, not just a co-parent. Check in, connect, share the load.

## 3. 🏠 Household Duties & Fair Play
The home runs on Fair Play. Do your cards. Handle your responsibilities.

## 4. 💪 Health & Wellness
You can't pour from an empty cup. Move your body, rest when needed, eat well.

## 5. 💰 Side Hustle & Passive Income
Music projects, sample packs, frmwrk_ radio, Sprawling Cosmic Blip — the work that builds toward financial freedom.

## 6. 🎨 Creative Projects & Brand Building
Pixelglitch, Soar, collectibles company — building the infrastructure even when there are no clients.

## 7. 👥 Friendships
Real but flexible. Let it weave into other priorities — game nights, collabs, shared experiences.

---

*When in doubt, work from the top down.*
